WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.920
You built a cooling centre.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.670
Can she use it?

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.300
It's open in the day.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.770
But her home stays hottest at night.

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.170
It's close.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.640
But she can't walk that far in the heat.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.180
An alert went out.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.240
But she has no phone.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.670
A ride there,

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.340
and a neighbour who checks in,

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.000
can make it reachable.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.420
Who can use the protection you planned?

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.480
Try the exercise at beat the heat dot Asia.
